                                            <TextBlock Text="How to use:" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#E8EAED" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="1. Quick Import: Paste vless:// or vmess:// link and click 'Import Link'" FontSize="12" Foreground="#8B92A5" Margin="5,0,0,2"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="2. Manual: Fill Address, Port, UUID, and select Protocol (VLESS/VMESS)" FontSize="12" Foreground="#8B92A5" Margin="5,0,0,2"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="3. Security: Choose none/tls/reality based on your server configuration" FontSize="12" Foreground="#8B92A5" Margin="5,0,0,2"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="4. Transport: Select tcp/ws/grpc/h2 and configure Path/Service Name" FontSize="12" Foreground="#8B92A5" Margin="5,0,0,2"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="5. Advanced: Set SNI, Fingerprint, ALPN for enhanced security" FontSize="12" Foreground="#8B92A5" Margin="5,0,0,2"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="6. Save and connect - View parsed configuration in status panel" FontSize="12" Foreground="#8B92A5" Margin="5,0,0,2"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Border>

